OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FApart from
OL,6,Fshowers in the far north, clear skies
OL,7,Ffor northern and central areas allow
OL,8,Ffrost and fog patches to form
OL,9,Fovernight, Rain and cloud pushes into
OL,10,Fthe south and southwest. Milder in the
OL,11,Ffar southwest, but feeling chilly
OL,12,Felsewhere.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FDense fog in central areas
OL,15,Fmay linger tomorrow, but plenty of
OL,16,Fbright spells in the north when it
OL,17,Fclears. Cloud and rain pushes into
OL,18,Fmuch of England and Wales later.
